{"title":"The Illuminated Windows of NYC","link":"https://kottke.org/26/06/the-illuminated-windows-of-nyc","date":1780326000000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780323177-401fbbf1.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780323177-401fbbf1.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780323177-401fbbf1.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780323186-ea6ea23d.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780323186-ea6ea23d.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780323186-ea6ea23d.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>For his project <a href=\"https://davekrugman.com/windows/explore\">Windows</a>, Dave Krugman took photos of hundreds of NYC apartment windows at night and stitched them together into ever-shifting typologies. What’s going on in each of those apartments?\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Dave%20Krugman\">Dave Krugman</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/NYC\">NYC</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"a08b61b5b035116381543acf61c9a5fc2f9064f70f42775bf4a33d16b29361eb","category":"Sites"}